## Artwork, audio and other game assets are NOT covered by the MIT license

The MIT license above applies to the source code only — the GDScript, Swift and
TypeScript files, build scripts, tests and documentation.

It does NOT apply to the game's creative assets, which remain
All Rights Reserved:

  - Godot/assets/characters/**   (character and enemy artwork)
  - Godot/assets/cards/**        (card illustrations)
  - Godot/assets/backgrounds/**  (chapter and battle backdrops)
  - Godot/assets/audio/**        (music)
  - Godot/assets/chest-atlas-v1.png, Godot/icon.png
  - Expo/assets/**               (the same artwork in the legacy prototype)

You may clone this repository, build it and play it, and you may reuse the code
in your own projects under the MIT terms. You may not redistribute the artwork
or audio, or ship a game that uses these assets, without separate written
permission.

